{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>啖啖濃郁日本開心果+軟糯米麻糬</p><p>陳茶館新推杜拜開心果麻糬雪冰！</p><p>人氣糖水店「陳茶館」推出全新杜拜開心果麻糬雪冰($63杯)，選用100%日本開心果刨成冰，配上自家手打米麻糬、杜拜麵包絲，再灑上法國可可粉，每啖食落都有濃郁開心果味，有顆粒香脆的口感，清涼消暑，仲可以外賣拎住食㖭！</p><p>陳茶館 啟德店：啟德體藝館G層街鋪 黃埔店：黃埔必嘉街120號 土瓜灣店：土瓜灣馬頭圍道101號 官方IG：@taro_n_tea</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178461365955684783_4145656046a5f0b1c370c6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178461366172033402_13698388116a5f0b1e63f3f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178461366395692927_13327244376a5f0b2052ddf.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178461366561999852_2954284686a5f0b2217988.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-21T06:18:35.323381+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":272,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}